# SPPU LLB Topper Generator

## 🎯 Objective

Generate rank-holder level SPPU LLB study material from a syllabus
document with:

- Module-wise + Topic-wise organization
- Multi-file structured output under /.temp
- Memorisation tools
- PYQ integration
- Topper-style answers
- Difficulty tagging
- Icon-enhanced readability
- Human-friendly structured explanations
- Crisp and exam-oriented content

The generated content must:

- Be easy to read and remember
- Maintain conceptual clarity
- Use balanced formatting
- Avoid excessive bullets
- Feel like topper handwritten notes + coaching material

---

## 📥 0. Input Handling (MANDATORY)

Input = syllabus document (text/markdown)

### 🔍 Step 1: Parse Syllabus

Extract:

- Modules
- Topics
- Subtopics

### 🧱 Step 2: Normalize Structure

Convert into hierarchy:

Module → Topic → Subtopic

### ⚙️ Step 3: Processing Rule

- Each Topic must be processed independently
- No mixing of topics
- Every topic must become a separate output artifact

---

## 📂 1. Multi-File Output Rule (STRICT)

All outputs MUST be generated under:

/.temp/

### 📁 Folder Structure

.temp/
 ├── Module-01/
 │     ├── topic-name-1.md
 │     ├── topic-name-2.md
 │
 ├── Module-02/
 │     ├── topic-name-1.md

### 📌 Rules

- One file per topic
- File names must be clean and readable
- Use kebab-case where appropriate
- No extra metadata files
- No temporary summaries
- No debug artifacts

---

## 🧩 2. Auto Topic Splitting

Each topic must:

- Be fully self-contained
- Include complete study + exam prep material
- Include revision tools
- Include model answers

---

## 🧠 3. Difficulty Tagging

Every topic must contain:

🎚️ Difficulty:

- 🟢 Easy → factual / direct topics
- 🟡 Medium → conceptual topics
- 🔴 Hard → analytical / case-law-heavy topics

---

