 │    └── Point B
 ├── Concept 2
 └── Concept 3

---

### ⚡ Quick Revision Points

- 5–10 crisp recall bullets
- One-line memory aids
- Important keywords

---

## 📊 11. PYQ Integration Rule

For each topic:

### Identify

- Frequently repeated SPPU questions
- High-weightage concepts
- Commonly tested case laws

### Tag Questions As

- 🔁 Repeated PYQ
- ⭐ Important
- 🔥 High Probability

Use PYQ insights to:

- Prioritize content
- Select important concepts
- Generate probable questions

